1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,264
Soomaaliya laba xilli-roobaad bay leedahay. Waa maxay sababtu?

2
00:00:04,364 --> 00:00:10,447
Gu': Abriil–Juun. Deyr: Oktoobar–Diseembar.

3
00:00:10,547 --> 00:00:15,600
Sababtu waa ITCZ: suunka ay dabayluhu isugu yimaadaan.

4
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:19,746
Dabaylaha woqooyi iyo koonfur waxay ku kulmaan meel u dhow dhulbaraha.

5
00:00:19,846 --> 00:00:24,266
Hawo kulul oo qoyan ayaa kor u kacda, way qabowdaa, roobna way noqotaa.

6
00:00:24,366 --> 00:00:29,789
ITCZ-du waxay raacdaa qorraxda: woqooyi Luulyo, koonfur Janaayo.

7
00:00:29,889 --> 00:00:33,212
Gu'ga, waxay Soomaaliya dul martaa iyadoo woqooyi u socota.

8
00:00:33,312 --> 00:00:36,425
Deyrta, way soo noqotaa oo mar labaad ayay dul martaa.

9
00:00:36,525 --> 00:00:41,292
Xagaaga, dabaylaha monsoon-ka (dabaylo xilliyeed) xeebta ayay barbar maraan.

10
00:00:41,392 --> 00:00:45,876
Waxay badda ka soo kiciyaan biyo qabow. Hawo qabow roob ma keento.

11
00:00:45,976 --> 00:00:49,128
Jilaalka, dabaylo qalalan ayaa ka yimaada woqooyi-bari.

12
00:00:49,228 --> 00:00:51,552
Maxaad rabtaa inaan sharaxo marka xigta?

13
00:00:51,652 --> 00:00:54,788
Like noo dhiib oo subscribe si aad wax badan u barato!
